#. TRANSLATORS: %s is the app's name, DomainMOD.
#: queue/add/rdap.php:195 queue/add/step-two/index.php:525
msgid "Each domain's site is checked once the domain has been imported. When %s has just one record of that domain, a new certificate is linked to it and gets the domain's owner, category, and IP address. Otherwise, such as when the domain isn't imported, the site is still checked, and a new certificate is added without a domain, using your SSL defaults."
